          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Nonconformance exceptions requiring action",
          "items": [
            "Requirement cannot be identified or conflicts across documents",
            "Affected lot, serial, time range, or quantity cannot be bounded",
            "Suspect product may have moved, been consumed, or shipped",
            "Physical segregation and system status do not agree",
            "Disposition selected without the required technical authority",
            "Rework or repair performed without controlled instruction",
            "Verification fails or creates a new nonconformance",
            "Disposition quantities or final locations do not reconcile"
